#: ../../source/docs/common-matek-uavcan-dlvr.rst:5
#: 7cfdbf2b36ff4a978e88ae38ce6488a2
msgid "Matek DroneCAN DLVR-10 Airspeed Sensor"
msgstr "Matek DroneCAN DLVR-10 空速传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matek-uavcan-dlvr.rst:7
#: c5a9ff90dcee417fb9ab8350843fd6be
msgid ""
"The Matek ASPD-DLVR is a DLVR-10 sensor with a CAN/DroneCAN or I2C "
"interface. The DLVR airspeed sensors are the highest precision, lowest "
"temperature drift sensors currently supported in ArduPilot. It can also be "
"used to attach a GPS and/or Compass and present them to the autopilot as "
"DroneCAN peripherals."
msgstr ""
"Matek ASPD-DLVR 是一款带 CAN/DroneCAN 或 I2C 接口的 DLVR-10 传感器。DLVR 空速传感器是目前 "
"ArduPilot 支持的精度最高、温度漂移最小的传感器。它还可用于连接 GPS 和/或罗盘，并将其作为 DroneCAN 外设呈现给飞控。"

